      "g6_8": {
        "science_biology": {
          "accent": "#7A1F2B",
          "accent_tint": "#F2DFE1",
          "page_surface": "#FBF4F5",
          "on_accent_dim": "#E0B4B9",
          "band_row": "#F7EAEC"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "banding_note": "Treatment groups reference the band keys in styles/grade-bands.json. Grades 5 and 6 currently fall in DIFFERENT bands there (g3_5 and g6_8), so they resolve to different treatments — lower_primary and upper_primary respectively. If you want grades 5-6 to share one look, add a g5_6 band to grade-bands.json and move it into a single treatment's bands[] here; nothing else needs to change."
